idation feedback from LMs (e.g. LLMs-as-Judges). Metrics can return `bool`, `int`, and `float` types scores. Check out the official [Metrics docs](/building-blocks/5-metrics) to learn more about defining custom metrics and advanced evaluations using AI feedback and/or DSPy programs.\n/testbed/docs/docs/learn/programming/modules.md:105:5. **`dspy.MultiChainComparison`**: Can compare multiple outputs from `ChainOfThought` to produce a final prediction.\n/testbed/docs/docs/learn/programming/modules.md:110:6. **`dspy.majority`**: Can do basic voting to return the most popular response from a set of predictions.\n/testbed/docs/docs/learn/programming/modules.md:241:            prediction = self.append_notes(claim=claim, notes=notes, context=context)\n/testbed/docs/docs/learn/programming/modules.md:242:            notes.extend(prediction.new_notes)\n/testbed/docs/docs/learn/programming/modules.md:243:            titles.extend(prediction.titles)\n/testbed/docs/docs/learn/programming/modules.md:262:usage = prediction_instance.get_lm_usage()\n/testbed/dspy/dsp/utils/metrics.py\n/testbed/dspy/evaluate/evaluate.py\n/testbed/dspy/evaluate/metrics.py\n/testbed/dspy/experimental/module_graph.py\n/testbed/dspy/predict/aggregation.py\n/testbed/dspy/predict/avatar/avatar.py\n/testbed/dspy/predict/best_of_n.py\n/testbed/dspy/predict/multi_chain_comparison.py\n/testbed/dspy/predict/predict.py\n/testbed/dspy/predict/react.py\n/testbed/dspy/predict/refine.py\n/testbed/dspy/primitives/__init__.py\n/testbed/dspy/primitives/prediction.py\n/testbed/dspy/propose/grounded_proposer.py\n/testbed/dspy/propose/utils.py\n/testbed/dspy/retrievers/embeddings.py\n/testbed/dspy/streaming/streamify.py\n/testbed/dspy/teleprompt/avatar_optimizer.py\n/testbed/dspy/teleprompt/bootstrap.py\n/testbed/dspy/teleprompt/bootstrap_finetune.py\n/testbed/dspy/teleprompt/grpo.py\n/testbed/dspy/teleprompt/simba.py\n/testbed/dspy/teleprompt/infer_rules.py\n/testbed/dspy/teleprompt/simba_utils.py\n/testbed/dspy/retrieve